=== ANSWER Z ===
**1989.**

The Berlin Wall fell on the night of 9 November 1989, when East Germany opened its border crossings after mass protests and an announcement of relaxed travel rules. Most of the wall was demolished later: official demolition began in June 1990 and ran into 1991. Germany formally reunified on 3 October 1990.

Reading chosen: "fall" means the opening of the border, not the physical demolition.

